---
import HobbyOrbit from "./HobbyOrbit.astro";
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col justify-center px-6 py-24 md:py-32"
>
  <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-5xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] md:items-center">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">About</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 border-l-2 border-accent/40 pl-5 text-slate-600">
        <slot>
          <p>
            I'm a Data/ML Engineer at Endava, where I build Excel-to-database
            pipelines in Python and pandas that cut manual analysis time by
            roughly 90%, and work with Azure and Snowflake on an insurance
            underwriting workbench. I hold a BSc in Computer Science from the
            University of Bucharest and am currently building toward an MSc in
            Data Science at Uppsala University (2026–2028).
          </p>
          <p>
            My bachelor's thesis explored multimodal emotion recognition across
            text, audio, and image, and I've since written up an LLM persona
            bias experiment as a submission to CATS 2026. Outside of
            engineering, I stay involved internationally — through the Leaders
            Foundation, the Susterum accelerator, and hackathons spanning tech
            exchange and AI governance policy.
          </p>
        </slot>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <HobbyOrbit />
      <p class="mt-6 text-center font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
        Literature · Traveling · Hiking · Running · Philosophy · Culture
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
